    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d237">

                <pb facs="0329" n="249" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg249"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to the Minister for Foreign Affairs of
                        Greece.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Our people and Government in their hour of grief are deeply touched by the
                    sympathy shown by the Greek Government and nation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
